# Full app dump from Muhammad's MacBook Pro (brew bundle dump, 2026-11-17). NOT installed by
# default; the setup script installs it only with: bash mac.sh --all-apps
# By hand: brew bundle --file=apps/Brewfile.full  (from `chezmoi cd`)
# Re-capture: help.hassanpi.com -> "Capture your apps".

